<p class="hint" data-l10n="" data-en="Faint dashed lines = the previous position. In a real model h has thousands of numbers and the vocabulary tens of thousands of rows, and h isn’t edited directly but changes indirectly as the parameters of all earlier layers are adjusted; here it is simplified to moving it directly." data-bz="1">淡色虚线 = 上一步的位置。真实模型里 h 有几千个数、词表有几万行，h 也不是直接被改，而是通过调整前面所有层的参数间接改变；这里把它简化成直接挪动。</p>
